* opb-wbo.md §4.4 option B, and here it is exact(): T = 10 exceeds the sum of
* costs (5), so no assignment can reach the threshold and it constrains
* nothing. Restricted OPB guarantees T = 1 + sum(costs) for competition
* instances where every interpretation is admissible, which covers most of the
* corpus -- but it must be CHECKED per instance, not assumed.
soft: 10 ;
[2] 1 x1 >= 1 ;
[3] 1 x2 >= 1 ;
